<title>USA: Ford CEO backs anti-lock brakes, airbags.</title>
<headline>Ford CEO backs anti-lock brakes, airbags.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Mich. 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co Chairman Alex Trotman issued strong endorsements Wednesday for two auto safety features that have recently come under fire -- air bags and anti-lock brakes.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't want to drive a vehicle -- personally -- that doesn't have anti-lock brakes,&quot; Trotman told reporters following the automaker's annual outlook at Ford's Product Development Center.</p>
</text>
